    "body": "> That would indeed be better 👍👍\n> \n> Either way, there would have to be a clean way to opt in to new behaviour.\n\nOne change that would be backward compatible is to add an opt-in way to style (or suppress) display of the value via a css pseudo-attribute like:\n```\noption::value {\n  display: none;\n}\n```\n",
